WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.338 --> 00:00:12.755
(slow music)

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.370
- [Narrator] Ever look
through one of these?

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.850
In parts of Africa,
chances are most likely no.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:24.860
This stargazer wanted to change that.

00:00:39.088 --> 00:00:40.640
- [Narrator] So, how do
you get more young Africans

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.178
to be scientists?

00:00:42.178 --> 00:00:45.040
Get them to become stargazers, first.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.622
But Houston, we might have a problem.

00:00:47.622 --> 00:00:50.705
(gentle piano music)

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.200
- [Narrator] So, how
do you get around that?

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.210
- [Narrator] Ah, and who's he?

00:01:14.843 --> 00:01:15.790
- [Narrator] And once it's all packed,

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:18.130
Susan and Chu load it up and off they go.

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:19.680
It's no easy task,

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:23.350
but they've reached 40,000
students in the last three years.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.580
Like these girls.

